				},
				{
					"id": 740760204,
					"content": "看來我們的競爭者沒有解出這裡的謎題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760205,
					"content": "此處的碑文寫著：「從不分離」…「生於一瞬，常與相違，伴你長眠」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "西摩爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760206,
					"content": "然後最後一句寫的是——「原初一滴」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760207,
					"content": "#之前幾處地方應該也有這種謎題吧。那些謎底，{F#妳}{M#你}們還記得嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760208,
					"content": "「影子」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760209
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740760209,
					"content": "「生命」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760210
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740760210,
					"content": "「愛」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760211
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740760211,
					"content": "唔…答案漸漸抽象了起來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760212,
					"content": "卡特皮拉、西摩爾，你們知不知道這個謎題的答案呀？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
