			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 740760401,
					"content": "我對「原初一滴」這個詞有一些想法。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760402,
					"content": "聽起來像是說世界創造之後的第一場雨。這種意象應該是古楓丹和水仙十字結社都很喜歡的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760403,
					"content": "那這怎麼可能找得到嘛！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760404,
					"content": "所以這一滴水已經融在所有水之中了。每一滴水都是原初的一滴。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760405,
					"content": "就像是原初的神把偉大的潛力散佈了開來。我們每個人身體裡也都有神聖的成分。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760406,
					"content": "但是答案這麼簡單的話，前面那人應該可以很簡單就供奉出答案啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760407,
					"content": "是這樣沒錯。應該是我錯了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760408,
					"content": "雖然它不是正確答案，但它仍然是個好答案。我只能說設定謎題的人不懂浪漫了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760409,
					"content": "他還笑你不懂安全呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760410,
					"content": "我無法作答。關於原初一滴的搜尋結果有一千二百筆。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "西摩爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760411,
					"content": "「世界上第一滴酒傳說是風神…」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760412,
						740760414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "西摩爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760412,
					"content": "好了，不用繼續了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760413
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740760413,
					"content": "好的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "西摩爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760416,
					"content": "這個，我似乎有些東西可以分享。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760417,
					"content": "有一個傳說，純水精靈是前代水神的第一滴淚。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760418,
					"content": "而大地上的第一滴淚，正是最早純水精靈理解了人類之後流下的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760419,
					"content": "世界上最早的眼淚不應該是第一個人類的嬰兒哭出來的嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760420,
					"content": "動物的流淚其實是排出鹽分，而人類在那個平穩的年代，就連出生時都是歡笑著呼吸的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760421,
					"content": "——傳說是這樣說的啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760422
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760422,
					"content": "其實我認為嬰兒的哭泣和動物的排鹽可以視作類似的非感性行為。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760423
					],
					"speakerTitle": "西摩爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760423,
					"content": "嬰兒哭泣有外界刺激和為了盡快填充肺部的雙重原因。須彌的生論派教科書是這麼寫的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760424
					],
					"speakerTitle": "西摩爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760424,
					"content": "所以答案是…純水精靈嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760425
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760425,
					"content": "那的確前面那人可能供奉不出正確答案呢！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760426,
						740760428
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760426,
					"content": "死馬當活馬醫吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760427
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740760427,
					"content": "我覺得這個方向還是很可靠的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760430
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760430,
					"content": "這個說法以我對水仙十字結社的理解來說，似乎也很合理。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760431
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760431,
					"content": "不知在何處做夢的「紅女皇」，永遠口是心非的「夢中人」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760432
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760432,
					"content": "你說的這些話比謎語本身還難懂欸！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760433
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760433,
					"content": "有什麼關係嘛。已經是最後的關頭了。不論怎麼樣，在這件事的最後，謎底就會揭曉。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760434
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760434,
					"content": "安，那就麻煩妳了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760435
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740760435,
					"content": "好，讓我試試吧…我萬一失敗了，你們趕快想想別的答案吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760436
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760436,
					"content": "打開了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760437
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760437,
					"content": "一定要拿到最後這塊，不然聖劍就會落到水仙十字結社的手裡了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "卡特皮拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760428,
					"content": "我覺得這個方向還是很可靠的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760429
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740760429,
					"content": "比起找風神之酒的死馬當活馬醫行為好多了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760430
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 740760414,
					"content": "試試吧…我們去蒙德…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760415
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740760415,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}要死馬當活馬醫的話可以換個可靠的方向吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740760416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
